WEBVTT

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.292
No, no, no, no!

00:00:28.292 --> 00:00:32.000
You'll never grow big and
strong if you're so picky, Hiyu.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.958
No, no, no, no!

00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:40.292
Then how about I cast a little magic?

00:00:40.292 --> 00:00:41.125
Huh?

00:00:45.042 --> 00:00:46.792
Strawberries...

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.375
Here you go, drink up.

00:01:01.917 --> 00:01:03.125
Yummy!

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:07.833
You certainly do love your
strawberries, don't you, Hiyu?

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.375
Yeah, I love 'em!

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.125
--So was it an mere accident, something planned,
--It has been two weeks since the mysterious

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:16.917
--or an act of terrorism?
--explosions that rocked the city,

00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:18.792
--There is not any apparent progress
--but so far investigations into the matter

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:20.792
--in investigations into this...
--have been unsuccessful in...

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.500
What's the matter, Misato?

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.958
Your grades haven't been too hot lately.

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:31.958
With exams coming up, this is no time to slouch.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.125
I'm sorry...

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.500
"Dark Arts Chapter The Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
It's you we're talking about,

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.625
"Dark Arts Chapter The Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
so I think you'll be fine, but...

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:38.625
"Dark Arts Chapter The Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
If you have problems, come talk to me, okay?

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:41.458
"Dark Arts Chapter The Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
If there's anything I can do, I'll be sure to help.

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:43.792
"Dark Arts Chapter The Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
Yes, ma'am. Thank you.

00:01:43.792 --> 00:01:47.042
Oh, by the way, does Hiyu seem okay to you?

00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:48.250
Huh?

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.833
He was out all last week, you know.

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:53.333
I wouldn't expect him to be out sick.

00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:56.458
Though I must admit he always seems like
he's about to drift off into outer space.

00:01:58.792 --> 00:02:03.417
Grades, huh? You want to be a teacher, right?

00:02:03.417 --> 00:02:05.292
Yeah, for now at least.

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:07.917
What do you want to do?

00:02:07.917 --> 00:02:09.208
Haven't decided yet...

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:11.958
Not yet? But you had
career counseling, didn't you?

00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:17.667
Sure I have, but still...
Aww, what do I want to be anyway?

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:22.625
What is it, Daigo?

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:25.125
What's on your mind?

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:26.458
Well...

00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:28.625
Huh? A business card?

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:32.458
"Kitajiro Nakamura,
Chairman, No-Nonsense Wrestling"...

00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:33.792
You mean you've been scouted?

00:02:33.792 --> 00:02:36.583
Wow! This is awesome, Daigo!

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:40.583
Well, yeah, but actually, I don't...
How should I put it? It's like...

00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:42.917
"Umeoka Cooking School
Enrollment Information"

00:02:42.917 --> 00:02:48.167
Lucky! So, Aoi's gonna be a teacher
and Daigo's gonna be a pro-wrestler?

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.083
Um, no! You see...

00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:53.875
I guess that's how it goes.
Plus, our fight is over now too.

00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:57.000
Gotta think of what's ahead for each of us now.

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:00.750
The future, huh?

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.500
Snake eyes!

00:03:04.042 --> 00:03:07.125
The world of gambling has no mercy, eh, guys?

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:08.333
You gotta be kidding!

00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:11.083
C'mon, hand over the rest of
those yakisoba rolls you got there.

00:03:11.083 --> 00:03:14.750
Oh, man... that's one week's worth of lunch!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.625
Huh? Um, Boss?
Something fell from your sleeve.

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:20.792
Kyouichi, are you cheating again?

00:03:21.792 --> 00:03:22.625
--There are also those of us who  have no plans whatsoever.
--What?! Boss!

00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:25.333
--There are also those of us who  have no plans whatsoever.
--Whoa, hold on. This is some kind of mistake!

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.375
--What's it been, a couple weeks?
--...and the yakisoba rolls. And the curry roll, and...

00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:33.208
Hiyu!

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:34.958
I'll look after him.

00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:46.667
Pullin' out that dangerous thing again, huh?

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:50.917
Don't go trying to steal
the spotlight, Doom 'n Gloom.

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:00.292
Aoi?

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:04.667
Oh... It's nothing!

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:07.333
So, have you decided on a name yet?

00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:11.917
Well, I'm just so wrapped up over
the number of strokes in the characters.

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:15.958
Considering the karma is fine
and all, but what's most important

00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:20.375
is that the name reflects your feelings,
regardless of how "lucky" it might be.

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:23.792
--What's this? Training again today?
--Naumaku sanmanda, bodanam baranai sowaka...

00:04:23.792 --> 00:04:25.917
--What's this? Training again today?
--Naumaku san--

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:27.000
Yes!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.667
It's really great how you're
out here every day. Good work!

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:36.583
Uh, it's nothing. Dr. Iwayama was
kind enough to teach me all this,

00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:41.417
so maybe I could help out
Misato sometime... or something.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.708
Ooh, nice Afro! It's burning!

00:04:59.042 --> 00:05:06.458
There is more than one
path open to you, Kisaragi.

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:09.333
Consider carefully.

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:29.125
Master, I do not know what my path may be.

00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:35.667
Hey, Kyouichi!
Is something the matter with Hiyu?

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:38.167
He went sprinting across
campus like his pants were on fire.

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:40.333
Well, y'see...

00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:43.792
Hiyu's been giving him the cold shoulder lately.

00:05:43.792 --> 00:05:44.958
Komaki...

00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:48.792
Actually, the past two or three days he's been
walking around grinning like I've never seen.

00:05:48.792 --> 00:05:51.917
Yeah, well, not as much today though.

00:05:51.917 --> 00:05:54.167
I'll be glad to head over to Koni's place with you.

00:05:54.167 --> 00:05:56.625
Could you cut out the bizarre sympathy?

00:05:56.625 --> 00:06:00.208
Heheh! I think I hear my cue!

00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:01.333
Not again...

00:06:02.542 --> 00:06:03.958
Listen, you...

00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:05.458
Where the heck did you come from?!

00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:07.500
You serious?!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.500
That's pretty interesting!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:13.792
Wait! That's my story. Don't you steal it on me!

00:06:13.792 --> 00:06:15.333
Sounds real interesting!

00:06:15.333 --> 00:06:16.542
I'll go too!

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:20.458
Wait, guys! We can't do this
just for the sake of amusement!

00:06:21.792 --> 00:06:24.625
As noisy as ever...

00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:27.292
Hello! I've got your carrots here.

00:06:27.292 --> 00:06:29.792
Thanks.

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:32.208
Huh, from Shizuoka this time, eh?

00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:37.208
What? No way! We only sell
carrots imported straight from China!

00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:38.375
Well, thanks!

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:48.875
This is tea, and these are
rice crackers, and this is, um...

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:50.667
Hi-yums!

00:06:50.667 --> 00:06:56.125
If we were to eat all that,
our bellies would be out to here!

00:06:56.125 --> 00:06:58.000
Huh? But...

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.958
--What's this now?
--Oh...

00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:05.625
H-Hi...

00:07:07.667 --> 00:07:10.792
Oh, my. Is this one of your friends?

00:07:10.792 --> 00:07:12.458
Uh, yeah...

00:07:12.458 --> 00:07:15.417
What? You're a potter?

00:07:15.417 --> 00:07:17.875
Nice! So, you're an artist.

00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:20.333
Oh, no! It's more like a hobby of sorts.

00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:22.083
So, you were having a personal exhibition here?

00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:26.125
Yes, it's really quite an honor.

00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:31.000
What's the matter? Why so glum, "Hi-yums"?

00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:36.583
--Mom!
--Oh, I heard that. "Hi-yums"!

00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:38.625
What is it, Hi-yums?

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:40.792
"What is it, Hi-yums?"

00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:44.833
So, you're Misato, are you?

00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:46.125
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:46.125 --> 00:07:48.333
It's just like what he wrote in his letters.

00:07:48.333 --> 00:07:50.083
You really are a very pretty young lady.

00:07:50.083 --> 00:07:52.292
Oh, my! No, not hardly!

00:07:52.292 --> 00:07:56.750
Well, I hope you and Hiyu
continue to get along so well.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.000
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:04.292
Guess the apple doesn't
fall far from the trees, huh?

00:08:04.292 --> 00:08:09.083
No kidding! I kinda feel like
we've discovered Hiyu's secret now.

00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:11.292
Right, Hi-yums?

00:08:11.292 --> 00:08:12.917
What's the matter, Hi-yums?

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:14.625
Yeah, really, Hi-yums!

00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:17.792
Your parents really are nice though.

00:08:19.458 --> 00:08:21.958
They're my foster parents though.

00:08:23.125 --> 00:08:25.542
I'm adopted.

00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:29.958
Doesn't mean a thing.

00:08:36.667 --> 00:08:38.833
"Kisaragi Antiques"

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:41.500
What happened to Kisaragi?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.917
His shop has been closed ever since that day.

00:08:44.917 --> 00:08:47.333
Wonder if he's up to something else now?

00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:48.417
Komaki!

00:08:48.417 --> 00:08:49.792
But...

00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:54.542
Sorry.

00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:05.375
Tatsuma?

00:09:06.542 --> 00:09:08.042
What's the matter?

00:09:13.458 --> 00:09:14.875
Nothing.

00:09:26.292 --> 00:09:28.542
You're lookin' pretty out of it, girlie!

00:09:28.542 --> 00:09:32.750
They call it "amnesia" when
you can't remember nothin', right?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.083
Depressing to see such
a young thing end up like that.

00:09:35.083 --> 00:09:40.042
Hey, girl! C'mon over here! This stuff is dee-lish.

00:09:40.042 --> 00:09:42.333
You come have some sushi with us now, y'hear?

00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:43.875
Yeah! Right on!

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:45.667
That's right, girlie, you join in too!

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:48.042
You can be friends with us now!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.833
Here goes.

00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:54.458
Odds!

00:09:54.458 --> 00:09:56.750
But it's even. Look.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.042
Ugh! Again?!

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:00.375
Jeez, where'd you learn the game?

00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:03.542
Amazing! Let me be your student!

00:10:03.542 --> 00:10:06.542
You got visitors, Boss.

00:10:06.542 --> 00:10:08.417
So this is where you were.

00:10:08.417 --> 00:10:10.417
She your gal, boss?

00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:13.083
Yeow...

00:10:13.083 --> 00:10:13.958
Hi there.

00:10:13.958 --> 00:10:16.250
Komaki Number Two...

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.375
Komaki, take care of that delivery
once you've gotten changed.

00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:21.125
All right.

00:10:21.125 --> 00:10:23.208
Lady Komaki?

00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:24.833
Hinano?

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.125
So, you've called everyone then?

00:10:29.125 --> 00:10:33.250
Going by the mood, you probably didn't
round up the gang for a friendly dinner.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.583
Have a look at this.

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:42.542
It appears he had been thoroughly
infused with the power of the Dark Arts.

00:10:42.542 --> 00:10:45.458
There is not a trace of decomposition.

00:10:47.417 --> 00:10:50.708
There's one thing I don't quite understand.

00:10:50.708 --> 00:10:52.500
What might that be?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.250
Kozunu was attempting to resurrect his ancestors

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.250
who had been wiped out by the
Tokugawa Shogunate, isn't that right?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.708
Indeed.

00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:03.625
Then why would his
ancestors turn on him like that?

00:11:03.625 --> 00:11:10.125
Their sleep must never be
disturbed, not by anyone,

00:11:10.125 --> 00:11:13.250
not even by their own descendant.

00:11:15.708 --> 00:11:18.750
Then why would he have even tried?

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:23.625
There is something collectively
known as the "Stars of Fate."

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:25.500
"Stars of Fate"?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:30.875
All people are born under a predetermined star,

00:11:30.875 --> 00:11:36.292
and the course of their life is
guided by their particular star.

00:11:36.292 --> 00:11:38.375
Like predestination?

00:11:38.375 --> 00:11:40.625
I suppose you could call it that.

00:11:40.625 --> 00:11:45.583
Your meeting with each other, as well
as your battle against Tendo Kozunu,

00:11:45.583 --> 00:11:48.292
all was guided by the Stars of Fate.

00:11:48.292 --> 00:11:49.417
Stars of Fate...

00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:51.458
Gimme a break...

00:11:51.458 --> 00:11:54.667
You're tellin' me our lives are
decided from the moment we're born?

00:11:54.667 --> 00:11:56.750
That's fuckin' bullshit.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.583
Lemme tell you something.
That ain't the reason I'm fighting.

00:12:00.583 --> 00:12:04.292
I'm with this bunch of my own free will.
And I fight of my own free will too.

00:12:04.292 --> 00:12:06.625
That's all there is to it.

00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:08.083
And that is fine.

00:12:08.083 --> 00:12:13.375
The Stars of Fate have
not predetermined all things.

00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:16.833
Making use of the Stars of Fate,
or being victimized by them,

00:12:16.833 --> 00:12:19.458
is also a matter of one's own volition.

00:12:19.458 --> 00:12:22.958
Your Bodhisattva Eye is
subject to the same principle.

00:12:25.667 --> 00:12:27.958
You have spoken to Doctor Iwayama?

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:29.250
Yes...

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:35.583
That Aoi Misato...
Her Bodhisattva Eye's healing powers

00:12:35.583 --> 00:12:38.667
are fundamentally different from my own.

00:12:38.667 --> 00:12:44.167
I treat my patients by sending my own chi
into them to extract their negative energy.

00:12:44.167 --> 00:12:45.292
I understand.

00:12:45.292 --> 00:12:47.292
However, she is different.

00:12:47.292 --> 00:12:53.125
She does no more than activate
and draw out their vital energy.

00:12:53.125 --> 00:12:55.750
It's not that she's actually giving them strength.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.250
But if she's able to save people that way, then...

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:03.208
There is a limit to the amount
of energy a single life holds.

00:13:03.208 --> 00:13:06.292
If too much energy is drawn out too suddenly...

00:13:06.292 --> 00:13:09.292
You mean it could shorten the subject's lifespan?

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:15.417
Then resurrecting those who
have already lost their lives...

00:13:15.417 --> 00:13:21.833
Would entail paying a much harsher price
than losing some of one's life force.

00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:23.917
It's a dreadful power.

00:13:23.917 --> 00:13:28.917
But if that is the Star of Fate she bears...

00:13:28.917 --> 00:13:34.458
If that is my Star of Fate,
I will take on this challenge,

00:13:34.458 --> 00:13:38.000
because I have allies in this fight.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.875
If meeting all of you was
guided by my Star of Fate,

00:13:40.875 --> 00:13:42.583
then I'm sure...

00:13:44.542 --> 00:13:49.208
If you become able to control your power,

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.292
then you'll also be able to use it to save lives.

00:13:52.292 --> 00:13:57.750
Persevere, and I will do what I can to assist you.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.625
Thank you very much.

00:13:59.625 --> 00:14:02.708
So, what are we here for?

00:14:02.708 --> 00:14:06.875
Did you call us all here just to relate that story?

00:14:06.875 --> 00:14:09.167
That ain't all, is it?

00:14:14.083 --> 00:14:15.625
Lady Aoi!

00:14:15.625 --> 00:14:17.292
Kisaragi?

00:14:20.208 --> 00:14:22.417
Master, what is the meaning of this?

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:31.583
I'm glad. We were worried about you, Kisaragi.

00:14:33.375 --> 00:14:37.292
You went on a journey, in order to have
the ten sacred treasures we recovered

00:14:37.292 --> 00:14:39.292
sealed away once more.

00:14:39.292 --> 00:14:43.500
That is yet another responsibility
of the Kisaragi clan. Well done.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:46.750
It was nothing. The treasures
have been successfully sealed.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.458
I'll be taking my leave then.

00:14:48.458 --> 00:14:49.833
Wait!

00:14:51.167 --> 00:14:52.958
Where are you going?

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.292
If you'll excuse me...

00:14:57.292 --> 00:14:59.417
No! Kisaragi!

00:14:59.417 --> 00:15:01.917
Lady Aoi, please let go.

00:15:01.917 --> 00:15:04.708
Please, hear me out.

00:15:04.708 --> 00:15:09.208
Forgive me, I... I...

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:12.333
You couldn't kill Aoi,
so you're ready to die, right?

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:14.875
Kisaragi!

00:15:14.875 --> 00:15:19.417
Jeez, cut this shit out, Doom 'n Gloom.

00:15:19.417 --> 00:15:22.500
Kisaragi, here.

00:15:24.667 --> 00:15:30.917
It was broken. I picked it up,
and I fixed it while you were away.

00:15:32.917 --> 00:15:37.000
I couldn't find all the beads,
there's still a few missing...

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:45.125
But it's a precious memory,
so I'd like you to have it.

00:15:45.125 --> 00:15:51.083
Please, stay with us,
just like you have up until now.

00:15:53.875 --> 00:15:55.542
Lady Aoi...

00:16:01.125 --> 00:16:03.042
--Big sister!
--The barrier!

00:16:05.458 --> 00:16:06.292
Kyouichi...

00:16:06.292 --> 00:16:07.958
Right.

00:16:07.958 --> 00:16:10.125
Please stand back, Lady Aoi!

00:16:15.875 --> 00:16:16.958
Him?!

00:16:16.958 --> 00:16:18.625
There's no way...

00:16:20.083 --> 00:16:21.500
Kozunu!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.083
Tendo?!

00:16:33.875 --> 00:16:34.917
Lady Aoi!

00:16:34.917 --> 00:16:36.542
Get out of my way, Kisaragi!

00:16:36.542 --> 00:16:39.458
Stop it, Aoi! There's something wrong with him!

00:16:43.583 --> 00:16:45.542
He's transforming into a demon!

00:16:45.542 --> 00:16:48.125
Master, this is...

00:16:48.125 --> 00:16:49.833
What the hell is that?

00:16:50.792 --> 00:16:56.875
The power of the Dark Arts is manifesting itself
through a spell that someone has cast upon him.

00:16:56.875 --> 00:17:01.958
The human we knew as
Tendo Kozunu perished in Todoroki Valley.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:09.958
What stands before us now is a demon,
fully changed in both body and mind.

00:17:18.792 --> 00:17:20.292
Stay here, Lady Aoi!

00:17:20.292 --> 00:17:23.042
Let go! I want to save that person!

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:25.042
--Let go!
--Absolutely not!

00:17:28.083 --> 00:17:29.042
We'll stop him.

00:17:29.042 --> 00:17:30.000
Yeah...

00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:40.792
--It didn't do a thing!
--The curse is very strong!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.667
--What the hell?
--He doesn't mean to kill us.

00:17:48.667 --> 00:17:50.208
Kyouichi!

00:17:50.208 --> 00:17:51.458
Make a square formation!

00:18:26.333 --> 00:18:27.500
The Demoniacal Horde?!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.958
Well, I ain't afraid of any loyal demons either!

00:18:30.958 --> 00:18:35.792
Hey, fucker! It looks like your five
buddies did us a favor and died quietly!

00:18:35.792 --> 00:18:38.542
Time for you to get the hell
back to where you came from too!

00:18:44.708 --> 00:18:49.083
Kill that person! Unconditionally
and without regard to circumstance!

00:18:52.167 --> 00:18:53.917
I will fight.

00:18:53.917 --> 00:18:56.208
There is more than one path open to you.

00:18:57.292 --> 00:19:01.208
There is more than one path open to me.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:08.208
You certainly said you'd
protect Aoi back then, didn't ya?

00:19:09.375 --> 00:19:11.417
Were those words a lie?!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.458
Kill that person!

00:19:15.167 --> 00:19:18.417
It's nice to meet you. My name is Aoi Misato.

00:19:21.958 --> 00:19:24.000
Komaki! Hinano!

00:19:27.792 --> 00:19:30.750
Please! Stop this!

00:19:32.375 --> 00:19:33.667
Lady Aoi!

00:19:49.083 --> 00:19:50.625
Kisaragi?!

00:19:52.917 --> 00:19:54.250
Bastard...

00:19:56.625 --> 00:19:58.458
You will never...

00:20:18.708 --> 00:20:22.125
Kisaragi... Kisaragi!

00:20:22.125 --> 00:20:25.458
Kisaragi... Hang on! Kisaragi!

00:20:25.458 --> 00:20:27.125
Kisaragi!

00:20:29.083 --> 00:20:31.125
Lady Aoi...

00:20:31.125 --> 00:20:32.792
Kisaragi!

00:20:36.958 --> 00:20:40.417
E-Even if it costs me my life...

00:20:40.417 --> 00:20:41.625
No!

00:20:41.625 --> 00:20:43.125
That won't happen.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.583
That won't happen.

00:20:50.583 --> 00:20:53.542
I won't let it!

00:20:53.542 --> 00:20:55.292
I've had enough of this.

00:20:57.042 --> 00:21:00.708
I don't want anyone else to die.

00:21:00.708 --> 00:21:05.292
I won't let anyone die, no matter what!

00:21:12.083 --> 00:21:13.625
Lady Aoi...

00:21:19.458 --> 00:21:23.292
Jeez, you sure like to keep to yourself.

00:21:26.458 --> 00:21:30.958
I'm with you. I won't let you
deal with this all on your own.

00:21:30.958 --> 00:21:32.333
Kyouichi...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:06.750
Why? He hadn't taken anyone's life!

00:22:06.750 --> 00:22:09.292
He didn't mean to kill us.

00:22:09.292 --> 00:22:12.583
He probably wanted us to finish him off.

00:22:23.125 --> 00:22:29.875
You suffered a lot, but it's over now.

00:22:29.875 --> 00:22:32.625
Now, you won't have to suffer anymore.

00:22:34.458 --> 00:22:38.083
Mother! Mother!

00:22:43.833 --> 00:22:45.583
Mother...

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:49.000
Mother...

00:22:51.708 --> 00:22:53.458
Mother...

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:14.042
Master, you said earlier that someone else had...

00:23:14.042 --> 00:23:17.500
Indeed. One does not so easily
come across such power,

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.458
not even a descendant of the Kozunu clan.

00:23:19.458 --> 00:23:23.542
It is likely someone else granted him powers.

00:23:23.542 --> 00:23:26.000
Maybe this was all that someone's calling card.

00:23:27.333 --> 00:23:33.958
To let us know that it isn't over yet.

00:23:33.958 --> 00:23:37.792
That's right. That must be it!

00:23:39.667 --> 00:23:43.125
Aoi's gonna keep on fighting.

00:23:43.125 --> 00:23:47.167
She'll fight until she loses her own life.

00:23:50.625 --> 00:23:53.583
If you're gonna die, make sure it's only after Aoi.

00:23:53.583 --> 00:23:56.333
It won't be too late then, will it?

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:07.917
"Next Episode"

00:24:10.792 --> 00:24:13.542
